    "title": "Indoor pickleball courts win approval in Dunwoody vote - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By HANNAH YAHNE ,\n13 hours ago DUNWOODY, Ga. — The Dunwoody City Council, in a 4-2 vote Sept. 28, approved the Marcus Jewish Community Center of Atlanta’s request to install indoor pickleball courts after site plans were adjusted to improve sound mitigation efforts. Council Members Joe Seconder and John Heneghan voted against the request,... Read full article",
